OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Ato be 'explored'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has said it is
OL,7,F"exploring" long-term options for
OL,8,FJodrell Bank Observatory, home to the
OL,9,FUK's largest telescope, after its
OL,10,Ffuture was put at risk.
OL,12,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,13,Ftold the House of Commons on Thursday
OL,14,Fthat the facility had a "secure future"
OL,15,Fand he had recently met staff at the
OL,16,FUniversity of Manchester, which runs
OL,17,Fthe project, to explore potential
OL,18,Fsolutions.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
