OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of UK's largest telescope
OL,4,Ato be 'explored'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn July, the funding body - UK Research
OL,7,Fand Innovation (UKRI) - said the site
OL,8,Fin Cheshire would not be prioritised
OL,9,Ffor further investment after its
OL,10,Fcurrent agreement ends in March 2028.
OL,12,FBut in September, Prime Minister Andy
OL,13,FBurnham pledged he would find a way to
OL,14,Fsave the telescope.
